 "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"><title>Merrow Line: Links and colours</title><style>@font-face{font-family:\"Familjen Grotesk\";src:url(\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/familjengrotesk/v11/Qw3GZR9ZHiDnImG6-NEMQ41wby8WbHoEj7E49PA.woff2\") format(\"woff2\");font-weight:400 700;font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:\"DM Mono\";src:url(\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/dmmono/v16/aFTU7PB1QTsUX8KYthqQBK6PYK0.woff2\") format(\"woff2\");font-weight:400;font-display:swap}.eb0stu:hover,.eb0stu:focus-visible{color:#12242e!important;text-decoration:none!important}@media (max-width: 480px){.ev3fzm{padding:20px 20px 28px 20px!important;gap:16px!important}.epbr0g{display:none!important}}</style></head><body style=\"margin:0;background-color:#f3f1ea\"><main style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow-wrap:break-word;color:#12242e;font-family:&#39;Familjen Grotesk&#39;, &#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:0;text-align:left;text-transform:none\"><section class=\"ev3fzm\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;padding:28px max(32px, calc((100% - 600px) / 2 + 32px)) 36px max(32px, calc((100% - 600px) / 2 + 32px))\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-end;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0 0 10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #12242e\"><div style=\"flex:0 1 150px;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2\">Merrow Line</p></div><div style=\"flex:1 1 0%;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column\"><p style=\"margin:0;color:#55636b;font-family:&#39;DM Mono&#39;, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;font-size:12px;text-align:right\">Links and colours</p></div></div><p style=\"margin:0;color:#0f6a70;font-size:18px;line-height:1.45\">Sea-green text, a <a href=\"https://merrow.example/a\" style=\"color:#00e;text-decoration:underline\">link with no colour of its own</a>, and a <a class=\"eb0stu\" href=\"https://merrow.example/b\" style=\"color:#c93a25;text-decoration:underline\">red link that turns dark on hover</a>.</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;box-sizing:border-box;padding:14px 16px;background-color:#e6e3d8;color:#7d5f14\"><p style=\"margin:0\">A column’s colour, inherited by its text,<br><span style=\"color:#12242e\">overridden by a span</span>, and <span style=\"background-color:#f5e3a6\">highlighted</span>.</p><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.25\">A heading in the column’s colour</h3></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:14px;line-height:1.2\"><p style=\"flex:0 0 auto;min-width:0;margin:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:4px 8px\"><a href=\"https://merrow.example/timetable\" style=\"color:#c93a25;text-decoration:none\">Timetable</a></p><p class=\"epbr0g\" style=\"flex:0 0 auto;min-width:0;margin:0;color:#55636b;box-sizing:border-box;padding:4px 0\">·</p><p style=\"flex:0 0 auto;min-width:0;margin:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:4px 8px\"><a href=\"https://merrow.example/fares\" style=\"color:#c93a25;text-decoration:none\">Fares</a></p><p class=\"epbr0g\" style=\"flex:0 0 auto;min-width:0;margin:0;color:#55636b;box-sizing:border-box;padding:4px 0\">·</p><p style=\"flex:0 0 auto;min-width:0;margin:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding:4px 8px\"><a href=\"https://merrow.example/help\" style=\"color:#c93a25;text-decoration:none\">Help</a></p></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;box-sizing:border-box;padding:5px 15px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.2\"><a href=\"https://merrow.example/1\" style=\"align-self:flex-start;color:#0f6a70;text-decoration:none\">Down a column</a><a href=\"https://merrow.example/2\" style=\"align-self:flex-start;color:#0f6a70;text-decoration:none\">Its second link</a></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:flex-start\"><a href=\"https://instagram.com/merrowline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Instagram\" style=\"flex:0 0 auto;min-width:0;color:#00e;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://cdn.tools.unlayer.com/social/icons/squared/instagram.png\" alt=\"Instagram\" width=\"24\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;width:24px;height:auto\"></a><a href=\"https://linkedin.com/company/merrowline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"LinkedIn\" style=\"flex:0 0 auto;min-width:0;color:#00e;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://cdn.tools.unlayer.com/social/icons/squared/linkedin.png\" alt=\"LinkedIn\" width=\"24\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;width:24px;height:auto\"></a></div></section></main></body></html>",
 "text": "Merrow Line\n\nLinks and colours\n\nSea-green text, a link with no colour of its own (https://merrow.example/a), and a red link that turns dark on hover (https://merrow.example/b).\n\nA column’s colour, inherited by its text,\noverridden by a span, and highlighted.\n\nA heading in the column’s colour\n\nTimetable (https://merrow.example/timetable) · Fares (https://merrow.example/fares) · Help (https://merrow.example/help)\n\nDown a column (https://merrow.example/1)\n\nIts second link (https://merrow.example/2)\n\n[Instagram] (https://instagram.com/merrowline)\n\n[LinkedIn] (https://linkedin.com/company/merrowline)",
